Subject: [PATCH] chore: setup repo with docker files and init script

---
 backend/Dockerfile        | 23 +++++++++++++
 compose.yaml              | 68 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 frontend/.dockerignore    |  1 +
 frontend/Dockerfile       | 13 ++++++++
 init_nginxproxymanager.sh | 50 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 155 insertions(+)
